  "components/about.html": "<section id=\"about\" class=\"section about section-tall\">\n  <h2>About Me</h2>\n  <div class=\"about-copy\">\n    <p>\n      I lead technical delivery. For fifteen years I have owned both sides of the work: the technical direction, and the organization required to take it into production. I still design and write the software. That is what keeps the direction credible.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      The engagements cross industries: enterprise customers, and the large partners who deliver with them. The substance is custom integrations, customer-facing applications, and the technical decisions that hold a program together when scope and priority move. I am the technical voice with the customer. I train the engineering teams who will run what we deliver, including international groups, in hands-on workshops. After go-live I stay accountable for production.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Today I lead squads of three to six, on client work and on internal work. I set the architecture, the roadmap, and who delivers what, and I remain in review and implementation. I have also taken a product of my own from idea to release.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
  "components/contact.html": "<section id=\"contact\" class=\"section contact\">\n  <h2>Contacts</h2>\n  <p class=\"contact-intro\">\n    If you need someone who writes the software and also holds the project together, write to me or connect on LinkedIn. I read every message and usually reply within a few days.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"contact-lines\">\n    <p><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> <a href=\"mailto:job@francescosanna.eu\">job@francescosanna.eu</a></p>\n    <p><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\"></i> Cagliari, Italy</p>\n    <p><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin\"></i> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/francesco-sanna\">LinkedIn</a></p>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"contact-footnote\">Also available for remote work, relocation, or regular travel.</p>\n</section>\n",
  "components/education.html": "<section id=\"education\" class=\"section education\">\n  <h2>Education &amp; Certifications</h2>\n  <ul class=\"education-primary\">\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i> B.Sc. Computer Science, University of Cagliari (2011)</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"education-additional-label\">Additional</p>\n  <ul class=\"education-additional\">\n    <li><i class=\"fa-brands fa-w3c\"></i>\n      <a class=\"noDecoration\" href=\"https://verify.w3schools.com/1QRUA6J16Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        W3Schools React, Certified React Developer Professional Level\n      </a>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n",
  "components/experience.html": "<section id=\"experience\" class=\"section experience section-tall\">\n  <h2>Experience</h2>\n  <div class=\"timeline\">\n    <div class=\"event\">\n      <div class=\"date\">Sep 2024 – Present</div>\n      <div class=\"details\">\n        <h3>Engineering Manager &amp; Technical Lead <br> <span class=\"at\">@Stackhouse – Spindox</span></h3>\n        <p class=\"role-note\">I write the code and I own how the work is directed, planned, and delivered.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Develop production features in React, TypeScript, and REST integrations, and ServiceNow solutions (SAM, ITSM, widgets, business rules, flows) on client and internal engagements.</li>\n          <li>Lead squads of 3–6: roadmap, sprint planning, backlog priority, and retrospectives with product and customer stakeholders.</li>\n          <li>Set the technical direction (architecture, trade-offs, solution design) and the organizational one: scope, priorities, and who delivers what.</li>\n          <li>Keep the quality bar in code review and pairing, and leave shared integration libraries so the next project does not start from zero.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event\">\n      <div class=\"date\">Jul 2012 – Sep 2024</div>\n      <div class=\"details\">\n        <h3>Professional Services Lead &amp; Technical Trainer <br> <span class=\"at\">@Vivocha</span></h3>\n        <p class=\"role-note\">Twelve years in customer delivery, from the developer who built the work to the lead who owned it.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Designed and implemented custom integrations and customer-facing web applications for enterprise clients across industries, including work with large delivery partners.</li>\n          <li>Owned engagements from discovery to go-live: requirements, technical decisions, and the relationship with the customer when scope or priority changed.</li>\n          <li>Taught international engineering teams in hands-on workshops on JavaScript SDKs and REST APIs, so they could run what we had delivered.</li>\n          <li>Stayed accountable after release as second-level support, including SLA-critical production issues.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event\">\n      <div class=\"date\">2010 – 2012</div>\n      <div class=\"details\">\n        <h3>Developer &amp; University Intern <br> <span class=\"at\">@Reilabs</span></h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Built front-end and back-end features for a web analytics product, including REST data feeds and interactive KPI dashboards.</li>\n          <li>Worked on metrics design and on page-load and database performance.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
  "components/header.html": "<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"nav-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Open menu\">\n    <i class=\"fas fa-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n  </button>\n  <nav id=\"site-nav\" class=\"navbar\">\n    <a href=\"#hero\">Home</a>\n    <a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n    <a href=\"#skills\">Skills</a>\n    <a href=\"#projects\">Projects</a>\n    <a href=\"#experience\">Experience</a>\n    <a href=\"#education\">Education</a>\n    <a href=\"#contact\">Contacts</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n",
  "components/hero.html": "<section id=\"hero\" class=\"section hero\">\n  <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"avatar\" id=\"trigger-logo\" aria-label=\"Play logo animation easter egg\"></button>\n    <div id=\"easter-egg\" class=\"noselect\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"egg-backdrop\" data-egg-close tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Close\"></div>\n      <div class=\"logo egg-stage\">\n        <div class=\"frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"line h-line top\"></div>\n          <div class=\"line v-line right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"line h-line bottom\"></div>\n          <div class=\"line v-line left\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"square top-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"square bottom-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"egg-core\">\n          <div class=\"letters\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"letter-f\">F</span>\n            <span class=\"letter-s\">S</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"egg-tagline\">You found the quiet layer.</p>\n          <p class=\"egg-hint\">Based in Cagliari. Remote work, relocation, or regular travel are all fine.</p>\n          <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"egg-cta\">Get in touch</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h1>Francesco Sanna</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Engineering Manager &amp; Technical Lead</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-buttons\">\n      <a href=\"resources/curriculum.pdf\" class=\"btn primary\"><i class=\"fas fa-download\"></i> Download CV</a>\n      <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn outline\">Get in Touch</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
