  "components/projects.html": "<section id=\"projects\" class=\"section projects section-tall\">\n  <h2>Key Projects</h2>\n  <div class=\"projects-layout\">\n    <article class=\"card project-card project-featured\">\n      <p class=\"project-label\">Featured</p>\n      <h3>Nomad</h3>\n      <p><strong>TypeScript, Expo, React Native, Hono, MongoDB, offline-first sync</strong></p>\n      <p>\n        A product I conceived and built: a mobile-first travel companion for trip planning, activity logging, checklists, companions, and attachments, with full offline use and cloud reconciliation.\n        TypeScript monorepo with shared domain contracts, SQLite on device, and structured sync and conflict handling. The MVP is feature-complete, with CI, automated test gates, and Italian/English.\n      </p>\n      <p><a href=\"https://nomadtravel.guru/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nomadtravel.guru</a></p>\n    </article>\n\n    <div class=\"grid project-grid project-grid-secondary\">\n      <div class=\"card project-card\">\n        <h3>Reusable Platform Engineering</h3>\n        <p><strong>TypeScript, React, REST APIs, integration libraries</strong></p>\n        <p>\n          I plan the engagement and I implement it: web delivery built around shared libraries, maintainable integrations, and less duplicated work across projects. Squad coordination stays attached to code review and implementation, not beside it.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card project-card\">\n        <h3>Enterprise Integrations &amp; Widgets</h3>\n        <p><strong>JavaScript, Angular, Node.js, CSS, REST APIs</strong></p>\n        <p>\n          I designed and built custom integrations for enterprise clients across industries, from scoping through delivery, plus embeddable chat and video-chat widgets with real-time messaging, notifications, and event handling, used across client portals.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card project-card\">\n        <h3>Technical Training</h3>\n        <p><strong>JavaScript SDK, REST API, architecture workshops</strong></p>\n        <p>\n          I designed and delivered workshops for international customer teams, from a first overview to hands-on work on JavaScript SDKs, REST APIs, and solution architecture, so the client team could own what we had shipped.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
  "components/skills.html": "<section id=\"skills\" class=\"section skills section-tall\">\n  <h2>Skills</h2>\n  <div class=\"skills-groups\">\n    <div class=\"skills-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"skills-group-title\">Software engineering</h3>\n      <div class=\"grid skills-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-html5\"></i><span>HTML5</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-css3-alt\"></i><span>CSS3</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-js\"></i><span>JavaScript</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-code\"></i><span>TypeScript</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-angular\"></i><span>Angular</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-react\"></i><span>React</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-mobile-screen\"></i><span>Mobile</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-node-js\"></i><span>Node.js</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-database\"></i><span>MongoDB</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-ellipsis\"></i><span>and more...</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"skills-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"skills-group-title\">Platforms &amp; delivery engineering</h3>\n      <div class=\"grid skills-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i><span>ServiceNow</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-plug\"></i><span>REST APIs</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fab fa-github\"></i><span>Git &amp; CI/CD</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i><span>Performance Tuning</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-ellipsis\"></i><span>and more...</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"skills-group\">\n      <h3 class=\"skills-group-title\">Project leadership</h3>\n      <div class=\"grid skills-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-sitemap\"></i><span>Technical Leadership</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-list-check\"></i><span>Project Coordination</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-people-group\"></i><span>Agile Delivery</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-chalkboard-teacher\"></i><span>Technical Training</span></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"fas fa-ellipsis\"></i><span>and more...</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
